# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.1


## API Changes

### GET /api/{domain}/{project}/badges/security-score
-  endpoint added


### GET /api/{domain}/{project}/install-command
-  endpoint added


### GET /prefix/api/{domain}/{project}/badges/security-score
- :warning: API path removed without deprecation


### POST /prefix/api/{domain}/{project}/badges/security-score
- :warning: API path removed without deprecation




## Components
-  the component security scheme `AccessToken` was added
-  the component security scheme `bearerAuth` was added


## Info
-  a breaking change was detected but the major version did not increase, from `1.0.0` to `1.0.1`




